{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/header_01_small.png?t=1744639160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What if Diablo and Inscryption collided with a twisted game of pool?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seems insane? It is \u2013 and it's spellbindingly satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/break_rules.gif?t=1744639160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a completely new, seamless take on the game of pool</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a mad, yet eldritchly entrancing combo of different video game genres, with elements of billiards, pinball and golf</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">we guarantee you haven't played anything like it</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/header_02_small.png?t=1744639160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pool of Madness is a loot-driven roguelite where <strong>your cue is an ever-evolving weapon</strong>. Upgrade, adapt, and challenge the void-born terrors once more, with new strange powers at your disposal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/equipment_unlock.gif?t=1744639160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">forge a personalised, eldritch cue from parts collected along the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">test your sanity and fight void-born bosses on different tables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">unlock new loot: powerups, balls, cue parts and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/header_03_small.png?t=1744639160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pool of Madness does not hold your hand, <strong>respects mystery and encourages experimentation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/fish_finish.gif?t=1744639160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Taking inspiration from all across the spectrum, from traditional roguelikes like Brogue, to genre-defining titles like Dark Souls and Inscryption... and - well - pool, it emphasises discovery and replayability, inviting you to break the rules and <strong>develop your own unusual strategies</strong> in order to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/lewitacjagif_30fps.gif?t=1744639160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">no hand holding, only the void</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">endless replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">freedom to experiment and break the rules</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/header_04_small.png?t=1744639160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>synergy of different gameplay system</strong>s allows for endless possibilities, approaches, rising stakes, mounting insanity, and emergent situations that result in a flow state. Become one with the void and challenge your friends to do the same!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/exploding_fish.gif?t=1744639160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">enter a flow state  as the pool balls start to explode, blood-pumping chain reactions fill the screen, stakes rise and outrageousness thrives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">play alone, with real or imaginary friends, locally or online</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/header_05_small.png?t=1744639160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Heavy fog envelops our ship as <strong>we navigate these unhallowed waters in search of the island</strong>. The captain\u2019s quarters continue to reverberate with unsettling laughter and faint incantations, hinting at a mind adrift, eroding what little morale remains among the crew.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/delusions.gif?t=1744639160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the unholy depths of Pool of Madness, a Lovecraftian-themed billiards game where the boundaries between reality and nightmare blur - perform rituals to appease the ancient horrors lurking beyond and try to <strong>unveil the secret of the missing ship crew</strong> as your mind disintegrates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or don't - ignore the story of the crew and focus on the rituals. <strong>You decide how deep to dive in.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In other words: <strong>Shoot some balls. Go insane. Try again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/store_gif_01.gif?t=1744639160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>15% of revenue</strong> will be donated to charity organisations (chosen with our community on Discord).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game is currently at an early stage of development. The early playtests and media do not reflect the quality of the final release.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2873750?t=1744639160","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2873750?t=1744639160","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/f1aa565f266e9c01bfc249bd2d3f8705dbc4c39a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744639160","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/f1aa565f266e9c01bfc249bd2d3f8705dbc4c39a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744639160","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{