yourself in the unholy depths of Pool of Madness, a Lovecraftian-themed billiards game where the boundaries between reality and nightmare blur - perform rituals to appease the ancient horrors lurking beyond and try to <strong>unveil the secret of the missing ship crew</strong> as your mind disintegrates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or don't - ignore the story of the crew and focus on the rituals. <strong>You decide how deep to dive in.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In other words: <strong>Shoot some balls. Go insane. Try again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/store_gif_01.gif?t=1744639160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>15% of revenue</strong> will be donated to charity organisations (chosen with our community on Discord).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game is currently at an early stage of development. The early playtests and media do not reflect the quality of the final release.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Bit Golem"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/header.jpg?t=1744639160","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257011530,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257011530/movie480.mp4?t=173